{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f3c2b1a-4d5e-4f6a-9b7c-1d2e3f4a5b6c",
    "name": "TPO SMD - Demo State + Composite",
    "description": "Coleccion para mostrar State y Composite sin usar la base de datos.\n\nLos items se guardan en memoria: al reiniciar la aplicacion el inventario arranca vacio. Ejecutar en orden (Runner de Postman) o seguir las instrucciones de cada request.\n\nFlujo:\n1. Reset\n2. Crear un colchon y recorrer su ciclo de vida: ingresar -> reservar -> despachar\n3. Intentar reservar el colchon ya despachado: devuelve 409\n4. Crear un lote de 5 colchones y repetir el ciclo: un solo request cambia el estado de los 5 hijos\n5. Listar para ver el arbol y el estado de cada hijo\n6. Reset\n\nLa URL base se configura en la variable baseUrl (por defecto http://localhost:8080).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Reiniciar inventario de demo",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/reset",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "reset"]
        },
        "description": "Borra todos los items en memoria. Ejecutarlo antes de empezar o para repetir la demo."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - Crear colchon (PRODUCIDO)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"codigo\": \"COLCHON-DEMO-01\",\n  \"estado\": \"PRODUCIDO\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/colchones",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "colchones"]
        },
        "description": "Crea una hoja del Composite. El estado es opcional: si se omite, arranca en PRODUCIDO. Si el codigo ya existe devuelve 400."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"arranca en PRODUCIDO\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql(\"PRODUCIDO\");",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"aporta 1 unidad\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().cantidad).to.eql(1);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Ingresar el colchon (State)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/items/COLCHON-DEMO-01/ingresar",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "items", "COLCHON-DEMO-01", "ingresar"]
        },
        "description": "PRODUCIDO -> EN_DEPOSITO. Requiere el request 01. Si el item no existe devuelve 404."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"pasa a EN_DEPOSITO\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql(\"EN_DEPOSITO\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Reservar el colchon (State)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/items/COLCHON-DEMO-01/reservar",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "items", "COLCHON-DEMO-01", "reservar"]
        },
        "description": "EN_DEPOSITO -> RESERVADO. Requiere el request 02."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"pasa a RESERVADO\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql(\"RESERVADO\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Despachar el colchon (State)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/items/COLCHON-DEMO-01/despachar",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "items", "COLCHON-DEMO-01", "despachar"]
        },
        "description": "RESERVADO -> DESPACHADO (estado final). Requiere el request 03."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"pasa a DESPACHADO\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql(\"DESPACHADO\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - Reservar un colchon despachado (409)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/items/COLCHON-DEMO-01/reservar",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "items", "COLCHON-DEMO-01", "reservar"]
        },
        "description": "Caso invalido: el colchon ya esta DESPACHADO. State lanza TransicionInvalidaException y el controller responde 409 con el codigo TRANSICION_INVALIDA. El estado no cambia."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"409 Conflict\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"codigo de error\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().codigo).to.eql(\"TRANSICION_INVALIDA\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 - Crear lote de 5 colchones (Composite)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"codigo\": \"LOTE-DEMO-01\",\n  \"estado\": \"PRODUCIDO\",\n  \"cantidad\": 5\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/lotes",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "lotes"]
        },
        "description": "Crea un Lote con 5 colchones hijos. La respuesta trae cantidad = 5 y el arbol de hijos. La cantidad por defecto es 5."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"cantidad total 5\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().cantidad).to.eql(5);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"5 hijos\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().hijos).to.have.lengthOf(5);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 - Ingresar el lote (cascada)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/items/LOTE-DEMO-01/ingresar",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "items", "LOTE-DEMO-01", "ingresar"]
        },
        "description": "Un solo request cambia el lote y sus 5 hijos de PRODUCIDO a EN_DEPOSITO. Requiere el request 06."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"el lote pasa a EN_DEPOSITO\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql(\"EN_DEPOSITO\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "08 - Reservar el lote (cascada)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/items/LOTE-DEMO-01/reservar",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "items", "LOTE-DEMO-01", "reservar"]
        },
        "description": "EN_DEPOSITO -> RESERVADO para el lote y sus 5 hijos. Requiere el request 07."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"el lote pasa a RESERVADO\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql(\"RESERVADO\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "09 - Despachar el lote (cascada)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/items/LOTE-DEMO-01/despachar",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "items", "LOTE-DEMO-01", "despachar"]
        },
        "description": "RESERVADO -> DESPACHADO para el lote y sus 5 hijos. Requiere el request 08."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"el lote pasa a DESPACHADO\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql(\"DESPACHADO\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "10 - Listar todo el inventario",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/items",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "items"]
        },
        "description": "Devuelve el colchon suelto y el lote con sus 5 hijos. Sirve para mostrar que el lote y todos sus hijos quedaron DESPACHADOS."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200 OK\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"dos items en el inventario\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.lengthOf(2);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "11 - Item inexistente (404)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/demo/items/NO-EXISTE/reservar",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "demo", "items", "NO-EXISTE", "reservar"]
        },
        "description": "Caso invalido: codigo que no existe. Devuelve 404 con el codigo RECURSO_NO_ENCONTRADO."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"404 Not Found\", function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
              "});",
              "pm.test(\"codigo de error\", function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().codigo).to.eql(\"RECURSO_NO_ENCONTRADO\");",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
